octavios
===========

Getting started
---------------

Please see the [octavios Wiki](https://wiki.octavios.org/) for building instructions, by device.


Submitting patches
------------------
Patches are always welcome! Please submit your patches via octavios Gerrit!

Simply follow our guide on [how to submit patches](https://wiki.octavios.org/submitting-patch-howto.html).

To view the status of your and others' patches, visit [octavios Gerrit Code Review](https://review.octavios.org/).


Buildbot
--------

All supported devices are built weekly and periodically as changes are committed to ensure the source trees remain buildable.

You can view the current build statuses at [octavios Buildkite](https://buildkite.com/octavios).

Builds produced weekly by the buildbot can be downloaded from [octavios downloads](https://download.octavios.org/).
